From d0a38a4f6c58fcf2d0ea1377017bcee30e34d296 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:20:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] sapphire: aw87xxx: update to Awinic v2.10.0 with Xiaomi
 changes

Stock sapphire ships Awinic driver v2.10.0. Import the public v2.10.0
Qualcomm flavour, drop vendor (Motorola) runin test and deferred spin
additions, keep the DSP-less dsp glue (stock imports no AFE symbols) and
re-add the Xiaomi changes recovered from the stock aw87xxx_dlkm.ko:
- defer until fs1815 probed; step aside if fs1815 is fitted
- report "<dev>-AW-" to lct_audio_info
- aw87xxx_get_prof_index / aw87xxx_show_current_profile_index
Verified: identical function set and exports to stock.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
